        <briefdescription>
<para>Start the timer and install a return-path callback that logs elapsed milliseconds. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Invoked by Drogon on its IO thread. The callback passed to <computeroutput>nextCb</computeroutput> runs when the response comes back from later middleware/handlers, so the measurement covers the whole downstream chain. The response is forwarded untouched to <computeroutput>mcb</computeroutput>. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
